{"id":"cb262770a7fc8548","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-prop-skolem.md","title":"Downward Löwenheim–Skolem (Skolem Paradox)","display":"prop-skolem — Downward Löwenheim–Skolem (Skolem Paradox)","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-skolem","aliases":["58-prop-skolem"],"display":"prop-skolem — Downward Löwenheim–Skolem (Skolem Paradox)","depends_on":["[[58-df-language]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[58-df-countable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-skolem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-skolem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-skolem — Downward Löwenheim–Skolem (Skolem Paradox)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d81b1b2123168018\" href=\"?note=d81b1b2123168018\" title=\"58-df-language\">58-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"58-df-elementary-substructure\">58-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"58-df-countable\">58-df-countable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\mathcal A,C\\in V\">\\(L,\\mathcal A,C\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_L\">\\(\\prec_L\\)</span> are the exact structure symbols.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span> is the registered countability predicate; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\)</span> is the parameter set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(L)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(C)\\to\\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal B\\prec_L\\mathcal A\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B))\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(L)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(C)\\to\\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal B\\prec_L\\mathcal A\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B))\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every structure in a countable language has a countable elementary substructure containing any prescribed countable parameter set; finite structures are correctly included.</li>\n<li>If ZFC has an infinite model, downward Löwenheim--Skolem supplies an externally countable elementary submodel; its internally uncountable sets explain Skolem's paradox.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"d81b1b2123168018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-countable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\mathcal A,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(L)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(C)\\to\\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal B\\prec_L\\mathcal A\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B))\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1361,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3994","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-prop-skolem.md|58-prop-skolem]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["d81b1b2123168018","d9b8711cda3f31ca","faf104362ffe13b3","1b3610e6aed65b25"]}